WEBVTT

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:03.720
Go, Beyond The Hope!

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.920
Why is it that you two keep on crushing our dreams, no, everything!

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:13.320
Yuma! Astral!

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.320
Shark...!

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.970
But I'm not finished yet!

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.500
Trap Card activate! "Seventh Around"!

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.320
When "Barian, the King of Dreams" is destroyed,

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:33.270
it and its Chaos Overlay Units are all banished, and damage to me becomes 0!

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.050
A card like that...!

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.300
I'm not done! Next, after the battle ends,

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:44.700
I Special Summon a Rank 3 or lower monster from my Extra Deck,

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:48.370
and then inflict its Attack as damage to my opponent!

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:49.750
What did you say!?

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:51.900
A counter attack just like that!?

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.070
Come, Black Ray Lancer!

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.230
This is the end!

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:00.470
Like the heck it is!

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:03.450
I activate the effect of "Beyond the Hope"!

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.020
I use one of its Overlay Units

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:09.270
to let me banish an Xyz Monster from my side of the field

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:13.020
to Special Summon "Hope, the King o' Wishes" from my Graveyard!

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:18.550
And then I gain Life Points equal to half its Life Points!

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:23.620
Do it, Black Ray Lancer! Black Spear!

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:39.770
I... set 1 card face-down... and end my turn.

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:45.550
Yuma...!

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:48.450
Shark...!

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:52.150
Hope and Black Ray Lancer are on the field.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.250
That reminds me... of our duel back then!

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.770
That's right, as we clashed again and again,

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.970
we'd end up talking to each other during our Duels!

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:08.670
Back then, you were such a pain in the ass.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.050
Bluntly shoving your way into people's hearts,

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:14.400
with your meddling in things that didn't concern you.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.400
Shark, because you're my friend. Even now!

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:22.250
You know, can't we go back to the way things were?

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:26.470
You're asking for the impossible.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:30.150
We're no longer who we used to be.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:33.670
You mean, we can't understand each other anymore?

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:38.320
Yuma, you don't get it, do you?

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:39.520
Hu? {HГ¤?}

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:43.950
We already understand each other.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.420
I've known how you've felt for ages.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.570
How you felt when you fought too.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:54.850
Shark...

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:59.520
But even if people understand each other, sometimes they just can't turn back.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.950
There are friends who believe in me,

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.720
and they are still fighting by my side.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:11.470
It would mean betraying those who believe in me...

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:13.700
... that's why I can't afford to lose!

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:15.650
Lose...

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.770
<i>Open The Door...</i>

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:22.420
<i>... if you do, you will obtain a new power!</i>

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:28.320
<i>But, the price of doing so is that thou will lose that which is most important to thee.</i>

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:31.000
Yuma...

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:33.120
Astral...

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.570
<i>What I'll lose...</i>

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:40.940
Now, come at me, Yuma!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:47.020
<i>... Astral...  or does it mean Shark...?</i>

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:52.200
<i>No...! There's no way I'd lose either of them!</i>

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:56.320
My turn! Draw!

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:57.420
{marker}

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:01.600
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:06.840
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.530
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:22.710
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:29.530
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:33.510
the feelings I want to express.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:42.530
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.780
Right now, with you

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:49.710
Oh - By facing each other,

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:56.790
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:01.890
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:07.320
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:12.490
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:22.070
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:30.680
Here I go! I'll have Hope, the King of Wishes

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.220
attack Black Ray Lancer!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:39.690
<i>"Final Hope!! We Are "Beyond"</i>

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:38.860
As if! I activate the effect of the Killer Rabca in my Graveyard!

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.110
By banishing him,

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.110
I negate the attack of my opponent

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.150
and lower its Attack by 500!

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.700
I set 1 card face-down, turn end!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.000
Yuma, Astral.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.630
I haven't forgotten that we met when I was "Shark".

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.670
But right now, I am <i>not</i> "Shark"!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.130
I am Nasch of the Barians!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.470
To guide the Barian World,

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.010
I will win this Duel,

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.430
and get the Numeron Code!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.440
Here I go, my turn!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.600
Draw!

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:24.860
I activate the Spell Card "Xyz Treasure"!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:28.910
I draw a card for each Xyz Monster on the field.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.160
Thus, I draw 2 cards!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:37.250
Then, I Special Summon "Big Jaws"!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:42.460
During a turn I activate a Normal Spell Card, I can Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.340
And then I Normal Summon "Skull Kraken"!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:53.350
I Overlay my Level 3 "Big Jaws" and "Skull Kraken"!

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.560
Xyz Summon!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:01.100
Come forth, "Submersible Carrier Aero Shark"!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.360
I activate Aero Shark's effect!

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:08.150
Once per turn, I can use one Overlay Unit,

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:12.820
to inflict 400 damage to my opponent for each card in my hand.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.990
I have 1 card in my hand!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.870
This is the end, for real!

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:22.630
Oh no!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.790
Air Torpedo!

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.630
Yuma! The Trap!

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:28.630
Sure!

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:32.300
Trap Card activate! Take Over Damage!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.760
When a player would take damage...

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.730
The Damage becomes 0.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:49.740
And then this card becomes an Overlay Unit to an Xyz Monster I control!

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:55.280
But that monster loses Attack equal to the damage that was negated!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:01.460
In that case, Black Ray Lancer, attack Hope the King of Wishes!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:05.880
Ain't gonna happen! I activate Hope's effect!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:10.340
By using 1 Overlay Unit, the attack is negated!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.340
Moon Barrier!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:17.260
But now Hope has no Overlay Unit anymore!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:21.180
I'll have Aero Shark attack Hope!

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:24.270
Numbers can't be destroyed in battle unless by a Number,

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:27.230
but, you still take Damage!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.480
Shark, you...

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.410
Yuma! Astral!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.830
I set 1 card face-down and end my turn.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:48.380
No... no way.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.760
Yuma and Astral's Life Points are 50...

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.180
<i>Shark, your determination is still unshaken?</i>

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.980
He's strong... just as Kaito.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.860
Really, I want to laugh.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.110
I want to laugh, because he's that strong.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:15.610
Yuma...?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:21.080
I was hoping everyone could just be together.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.910
That me and him could stay friends and all...

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:28.460
But... but just... this time, somehow...

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:32.710
This time, somehow, I can't seem to find an answer.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.760
Just what am I doing?

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.970
Even though we gave our all together to beat Don Thousand...

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:45.850
... me and my best friend are shredding each other in this duel.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.310
I... I...

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.230
Yuma...

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.740
It's no use giving up!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:08.120
Setting yourself limits, Yuma, that not like you at all!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:12.590
Because everyone... because everyone's entrusted their hopes to you!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.340
Kotori...

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:19.300
So... So, will you behave like yourself until the end, Yuma!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.010
Kotori, you...

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.350
She just scolded you, Yuma.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.730
Kind of like how Akari would.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:29.730
Totally.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.730
You're right, Kotori.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.480
It's just like you said.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:42.320
I still... have to find an answer!

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.330
Let's go, Astral!

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.160
Yeah!

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.330
Me with...

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.160
... with me...

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.370
... we overlay!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.630
Our hearts and minds shine with hope.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.130
Our souls are bond by true bonds of friendship.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:04.430
When two souls cross, a miraculous power handed down through the ages appears.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.980
XYZ CHANGE

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.230
ZEXAL!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:18.320
Come, ZEXAL, hit me with everything you've got!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.780
Right! My turn!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:24.030
Everything is inevitable in the Duels between the Strongest Duelists.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:27.240
Those Duelists can create the very cards they draw!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.960
SHINING DRAW!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.630
It's here, Shark!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:38.170
I Normal Summon "ZEXAL Weapon - Sylphid Wing"!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:42.430
If I control a Hope the King of Wishes,

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.930
this card can equip itself to it

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:49.560
and have Hope's ATK go up by 800.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:54.400
Sylphid Change, Hope!

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:00.900
I'll have Sylphid Hope attack Aero Shark!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.240
Trap Card activate, Seventh Arrival!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:10.040
By releasing all the Xyz Monsters I control,

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:16.250
then the Xyz Monster that was banished during my previous turn,

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.210
is Special Summoned!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:19.670
What!?

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:25.090
Return once more, Chaos Xyz... Barian, the King of Dreams!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.600
That monster's back!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:35.560
Then, monsters equal to the number of monsters released plus one...

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:40.820
attach a number of my banished Xyz Monsters as Overlay Units.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.610
Thus, Barian the King of Dreams, has 3000 Attack!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:48.450
However, the monster Special Summoned by its effect

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:52.500
cannot use any effects that would use Xyz Material.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.080
But I'm not done yet!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:59.340
Now, Sylphid Wing's effect activates!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.760
When our opponent Special Summons an Xyz Monster,

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:07.800
the equipped monster gains 1600 ATK!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:13.480
Go, Hope! Attack Barian, the King of Dreams!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:16.940
Hope Sword Sylphid Slash!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.480
As if!

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.480
I activate the Trap Card "Draw, Reset Battle"!

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:25.610
During a battle, both players draw a card

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.910
and the attacking monster's attack is negated.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.450
That attack too...!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:36.580
I'm not done! That isn't the full effect of "Draw, Reset Battle"!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:40.500
If a player doesn't use the card drawn by this card's effect during this turn,

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.300
that player loses.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.300
What?!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.760
That's right, this is our Destiny Draw!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:53.430
The all-deciding '<i>Last Draw</i>'.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.980
Our... final draw.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:07.360
Let's go, Yuma, Astral.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.160
Barian's Chaos Draw!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.450
Here we come, Shark!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.580
Shining Draw!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:24.920
<i>This card.... </i>

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:27.670
<i>.... is our card of destiny?</i>

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:33.930
Yuma, are we going to win, or is Nasch?

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.230
Everything depends on this one card.

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.650
Yeah... I'm gonna bring it to 'im!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.570
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Card "Double Up Chance"!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.320
When a monster's attack is negated,

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:52.490
this card doubles that monster's Attack,

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.490
and lets it attack again!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:15:00.080
The goddess of victory is now smiling at us for the first time this Duel.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.540
If Hope's attack goes through...

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.420
That's right, Shark!

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.590
This is our victory...

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:12.090
<i>Thou shalt lose that which is most important to thee.</i>

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:16.430
<i>So.... that's what the door meant...</i>

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.520
Yuma, why did you...?

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.360
Why did you undo ZeXal!?

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.110
Astral...

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.910
... I lost what was most important to me.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.780
That Door told me this would happen.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.410
The most important thing to me that I lost...

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.920
... that is myself.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:48.300
Yeah, as of now, I'm no longer me anymore!

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:55.220
I'm me when I understand my friends and my enemies.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:58.220
That a day comes, when we can Duel laughing with each other.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.430
I fought believin' in this.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.650
Just, if I win this Duel with Shark,

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:07.770
I would have to use the god-like power of the Numeron Code...

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.950
Even though I wouldn't want to get rid of Shark's life and all...

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:17.240
I mean, even now the guy is my best fiend!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:21.910
Is a future you grab at the cost of your friends really a better one?

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.630
Is such a future really a good future for us?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:29.670
I know, that everyone placed their hopes in me.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.420
But I... I...

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:34.930
I understand, Yuma.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:35.840
Hu? {HГ¤?}

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:40.890
You always have opened the path to the future by believing in others.

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:46.810
Whatever the answer turns out to be, I will always be with you.

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:48.940
Astral...

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.190
Here I come, Shark!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:55.990
Yuma, Astral... Come on!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:17:00.330
I activate Sylphid Wing's effect!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:03.580
When the equipped monster attacks,

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:05.960
this card becomes an Xyz Material!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.790
Yuma, why!?

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.500
Go! Hope!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.880
Attack Barian, the King of Wishes!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:16.050
Hope Sword Double Slash!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:21.060
Now, I activate Hope's effect!

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.810
By using one Overlay Unit...

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:29.400
... I can negate Hope's attack!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:34.610
That's... You negate your own attack!?

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.950
What are you up to? Yuma!

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.160
Nothing at all.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:45.000
Shark... I don't want to sacrifice you for the future.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:52.050
Idiot, do you even have a clue about what you're saying?

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.050
Sure. Even though our life is just 50 Points,

00:17:56.930 --> 00:18:00.050
I'll show you that we'll still take any of your attacks.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.760
Until we can find a new future!

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.100
For ever and on!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:10.610
Is that the answer you found in this Duel?

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.110
Yes! Sure it is.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.240
Without regrets!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:19.160
For being me is, when I don't abandon any of my friends.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.410
That's my bring it to 'em!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.000
You're a huge idiot, as usual.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:32.630
However, I activate the Quick-Play Spell "Glorious Seven"!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:35.590
If I control a "Chaos" Xyz Monster,

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:40.470
I can activate this card from my hand and then attach every one of my banished Chaos Numbers to that monster

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:42.930
as Chaos Overlay Units!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:47.100
Thus, this monster's Attack is now 7000!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:52.980
Then, during this turn, Barian, King of Dreams can't be destroyed by battle

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.860
and all damage is negated.

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:59.200
And any damage I would of taken

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.280
is inflicted to you guys instead.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.700
What?! Then, if our attack with Double-Up Chance had...

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.910
... we would have got the damage and have lost?

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.290
So then this turn's battle is a draw?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.170
No...

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.380
You have won.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.300
Wha- what?!

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.970
With Glorious Seven, the amount of my Life Points at the end of the battle

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:29.690
will become the same as the change to my opponent's Life Points.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.900
The change in your Life Points was Zero.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.150
So, my Life Points now are...

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.900
Zero.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.200
Shark!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.240
Shark!!

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:57.460
<i>Gracious... You're some guy...</i>

00:19:58.460 --> 00:19:59.670
<i>But...</i>

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.930
Shark...! Shark!

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.650
Shark! Hoy!

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.360
I just knew it...

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:23.070
That you would use Double-Up Chance, I mean.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:27.910
Geez... But that you ninny wouldn't let your attack go through...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.620
Really, I didn't expect <i>that</i>.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:33.960
But Yuma, Astral...

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.540
Your words had left a mark in me.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.710
Shark...

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.090
Don't tell me, then from the beginning you were...?

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:44.760
Don't be foolish. I was completely serious.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.430
But I have no regrets.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:51.930
Yuma... when they grow up, people often throw away what's most important to them.

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:56.440
But, you should never sacrifice that.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:01.570
The power to believe in people, the heart that never gives up...

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:03.780
... never sacrifice them.

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.410
Sha- Shark!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.460
I would also have liked to see your future along side you, but...

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.870
... it seems like I can't.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.880
Ah...?! Oy!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:22.550
Kotori! Don't take your eyes off that idiot.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.590
Thank you, Yuma. Astral.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:29.010
My best friends.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:34.770
That final duel with you guys was the best we ever had.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.650
Shaaark!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.110
'Later...!

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:10.180
{marker}

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:11.850
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:16.270
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.600
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:22.070
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:24.820
Let it go.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:38.160
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:43.380
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:49.300
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:54.640
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:59.440
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.360
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:07.530
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:11.910
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:15.790
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:17.540
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:22.000
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.130
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.960
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.380
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.890
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:42.560
There's the Numeron Code!

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:45.570
I'm going to destroy the Barian World.

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:47.820
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II:

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:50.570
The Ceremonial Fight!! Yuma vs. Astral

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:53.950
Duel me, Astral! You're my opponent!
